OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after rape report    
OL,4,Afaces no further action                
OL,6,FA man arrested after a woman reported  
OL,7,Fbeing raped on Southampton Common will 
OL,8,Fface no further action.                
OL,10,FThe woman, aged in her 30s, told police
OL,11,Fshe was attacked near Cemetery Road on 
OL,12,F7 November. Police said she had since  
OL,13,Fbeen supported by specialist officers. 
OL,15,FHampshire Police said a 42-year-old    
OL,16,Fman, from Southampton, arrested and    
OL,17,Flater bailed with strict conditions had
OL,18,Fnow been been released with no further 
OL,19,Faction.                                
